		"description": "<p>As a gaoler, you are proficient with Nets and treat their range as 15/30. In addition, your are able to apply manacles to a grappled medium sized or smaller creature so long as you succeed at an additional grapple check and have manacles readied like a weapon. For a large creature that is restrained and prone, you can apply a chain in the same way.</p>",
